{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24821","headline":"赋得玉水记方流 · 王监","name":"赋得玉水记方流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉润在中洲，光临碕岸幽。\n氤氲冥瑞影，演瀁度方流。\n乍似轻涟合，还疑骇浪收。\n夤缘知有异，洞彻信无俦。\n比德称殊赏，含辉处至柔。\n沈沦如见念，况乃属时休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王监","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}